 for encrypted traffic</text></navLabel><content src="ar01s06.html#idp49313696"/></navPoint><navPoint id="idp49313952" playOrder="51"><navLabel><text>6.2.4. Using the same port for both encrypted and non-encrypted traffic</text></navLabel><content src="ar01s06.html#idp49313952"/></navPoint><navPoint id="idp49358800" playOrder="52"><navLabel><text>6.2.5. Verifying the SSL/TLS setup when using a different SSL port</text></navLabel><content src="ar01s06.html#idp49358800"/></navPoint><navPoint id="idp49359536" playOrder="53"><navLabel><text>6.2.6. Verifying the SSL/TLS setup when using one port for both encrypted and non-encrypted traffic</text></navLabel><content src="ar01s06.html#idp49359536"/></navPoint></navPoint><navPoint id="idp49399808" playOrder="54"><navLabel><text>6.3. Enabling postfix at boot time</text></navLabel><content src="ar01s06.html#idp49399808"/></navPoint></navPoint><navPoint id="idp49402976" playOrder="55"><navLabel><text>7. Setting up fetchmail</text></navLabel><content src="ar01s07.html"/><navPoint id="idp49410608" playOrder="56"><navLabel><text>7.1. Configuring fetchmail</text></navLabel><content src="ar01s07.html#idp49410608"/></navPoint><navPoint id="idp49410896" playOrder="57"><navLabel><text>7.2. Starting and enabling fetchmail at boot time</text></navLabel><content src="ar01s07.html#idp49410896"/></navPoint></navPoint><navPoint id="idp49441760" playOrder="58"><navLabel><text>8. Setting up spamassassin</text></navLabel><content src="ar01s08.html"/><navPoint id="idp49462976" playOrder="59"><navLabel><text>8.1. Configuring spamassassin Bayes auto learning</text></navLabel><content src="ar01s08.html#idp49462976"/></navPoint><navPoint id="idp49470384" playOrder="60"><navLabel><text>8.2. Verifying spamassassin</text></navLabel><content src="ar01s08.html#idp49470384"/></navPoint></navPoint><navPoint id="idp49500688" playOrder="61"><navLabel><text>9. Setting up procmail</text></navLabel><content src="ar01s09.html"/><navPoint id="idp49504544" playOr